    {
      "ConcreteType": "Dynamo.Graph.Nodes.CodeBlockNodeModel, DynamoCore",
      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "//Corrected Index\nList.IndexOf(mapped@L2<1>,\nList.Chop(List.MinimumItem(mapped), 1)@L2<1>\n);\nmapped =\nList.Chop(List.Flatten(\nMath.Sqrt(Math.Pow(\noriginalAngleFromX<1> - degreesSorted<2>,\n2))\n),List.Count(degreesSorted));\n\noriginalAngleFromX =\nangleFromX>90?\n180-angleFromX:\nangleFromX;",
